  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "8",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "SNG 8"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "8",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "SNG 8:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "O that thou",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "SNG.8.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "SNG.8.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "wert",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "SNG.8.1",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "SNG.8.1"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "as my brother, that sucked the breasts of my mother!",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "SNG.8.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "SNG.8.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "when",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "SNG.8.1",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "SNG.8.1"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "I should find thee without, I would kiss thee; yea, I should not be despised.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "SNG.8.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "SNG.8.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "SNG.8.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "SNG.8.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "SNG 8:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "I would lead thee,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "SNG.8.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "SNG.8.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "and",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "SNG.8.2",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "SNG.8.2"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "bring thee into my mother's house,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "SNG.8.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "SNG.8.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "who",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "SNG.8.2",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "SNG.8.2"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "would instruct me: I would cause thee to drink of spiced wine of the juice of my pomegranate.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "SNG.8.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "SNG.8.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "SNG 8:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "His left hand",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "SNG.8.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "SNG.8.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "should be",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "SNG.8.3",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "SNG.8.3"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "under my head, and his right hand should embrace me.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "SNG.8.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "SNG.8.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "SNG 8:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "I charge you, O daughters of Jerusalem, that ye stir not up, nor awake",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "SNG.8.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "SNG.8.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "my",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "SNG.8.4",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "SNG.8.4"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "love, until he please.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "SNG.8.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "SNG.8.4"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "SNG 8:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Who",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "SNG.8.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "SNG.8.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "is",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "SNG.8.5",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "SNG.8.5"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "this that cometh up from the wilderness, leaning upon her beloved? I raised thee up under the apple tree: there thy mother brought thee forth: there she brought thee forth",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "SNG.8.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "SNG.8.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "that",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "SNG.8.5",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "SNG.8.5"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "bare thee.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "SNG.8.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "SNG.8.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "SNG 8:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "¶ Set me as a seal upon thine heart, as a seal upon thine arm: for love",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "SNG.8.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "SNG.8.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "is",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "SNG.8.6",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "SNG.8.6"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "strong as death; jealousy",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "SNG.8.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "SNG.8.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "is",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "SNG.8.6",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "SNG.8.6"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "cruel as the grave: the coals thereof",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "SNG.8.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "SNG.8.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "are",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "SNG.8.6",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "SNG.8.6"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "coals of fire,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "SNG.8.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "SNG.8.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "which hath a",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "SNG.8.6",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "SNG.8.6"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "most vehement flame.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "SNG.8.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "SNG.8.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "SNG.8.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "SNG.8.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "SNG 8:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Many waters cannot quench love, neither can the floods drown it: if",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "SNG.8.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "SNG.8.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "a",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "SNG.8.7",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "SNG.8.7"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "man would give all the substance of his house for love, it would utterly be contemned.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "SNG.8.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "SNG.8.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "SNG 8:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "¶ We have a little sister, and she hath no breasts: what shall we do for our sister in the day when she shall be spoken for?",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "SNG.8.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "SNG.8.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "SNG 8:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "If she",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "SNG.8.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "SNG.8.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "be",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "SNG.8.9",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "SNG.8.9"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "a wall, we will build upon her a palace of silver: and if she",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "SNG.8.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "SNG.8.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "be",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "SNG.8.9",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "SNG.8.9"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "a door, we will inclose her with boards of cedar.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "SNG.8.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "SNG.8.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "SNG 8:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "I",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "SNG.8.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "SNG.8.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "am",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "SNG.8.10",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "SNG.8.10"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "a wall, and my breasts like towers: then was I in his eyes as one that found favour.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "SNG.8.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "SNG.8.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "SNG.8.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "SNG.8.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "SNG 8:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Solomon had a vineyard at Baal-hamon; he let out the vineyard unto keepers; every one for the fruit thereof was to bring a thousand",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "SNG.8.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "SNG.8.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "pieces",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "SNG.8.11",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "SNG.8.11"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "of silver.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "SNG.8.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "SNG.8.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "SNG 8:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "My vineyard, which",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "SNG.8.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "SNG.8.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "is",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "SNG.8.12",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "SNG.8.12"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "mine,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "SNG.8.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "SNG.8.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "is",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "SNG.8.12",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "SNG.8.12"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "before me: thou, O Solomon,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "SNG.8.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "SNG.8.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "must have",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "SNG.8.12",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "SNG.8.12"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "a thousand, and those that keep the fruit thereof two hundred.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "SNG.8.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "SNG.8.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "SNG 8:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Thou that dwellest in the gardens, the companions hearken to thy voice: cause me to hear",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "SNG.8.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "SNG.8.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "it",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "SNG.8.13",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "SNG.8.13"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": ".",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "SNG.8.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "SNG.8.13"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "SNG 8:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "¶ Make haste, my beloved, and be thou like to a roe or to a young hart upon the mountains of spices.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "SNG.8.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "SNG.8.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
